  "prefLabel": "Env-WC 204.02 Supplemental Materials",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-WC 204.02 Supplemental Materials. Unless otherwise agreed at a prehearing conference, memoranda, briefs, and other written materials designed to supplement a notice of appeal shall be filed in accordance with Env-WC 202.06(b) and served in accordance with Env-WC 203.08 at least 10 business days prior to the scheduled hearing on the appeal.\n\nSource. #8977-A, eff 9-14-07 (from Env-WC 203.15)",
